entries[101546] = { ["name"] = "Spinning Crane Kick", ["text"] = "7.15% of base mana / 40 Energy\nChanneled (2.25 sec cast)\nRequires Serpent Stance, Ox Stance, Tiger Stance\nYou spin while kicking in the air, dealing [1.59 * ( 1.10063 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Min DPS * [0.75] 1 + 0 ) + Attack Power / 14 - 1) * 1 )] to [1.59 * ( 1.10063 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Max DPS * [0.75] 1 + 0 ) + Attack Power / 14 + 1) * 1 )] damage to all nearby enemies [ Teachings of the Monastery : and [ 2809 + (Spell Power * 0.1152)] healing to nearby allies ]every 0.75 sec, within 8 yards. Movement speed is reduced by 30%. Generates 1 Chi, if it hits at least 3 targets. Lasts 2.25 sec.\n\nDuring Spinning Crane Kick, you can continue to dodge and parry." }
